error[Z0410]: `suffixes:` cannot go with `join: semi`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:97
  |
1 | frame(k = [1, 2], v = [1, 2]).merge(frame(k = [1, 2], v = [3, 4]), on: k, join: semi, suffixes: ["_a", "_b"])
